{"3997850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GODWAY: Only Up Simulator", "steam_appid": 3997850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/4b4d5233a822f7db0826c93f05810835.avif?t=1778571483\" width=1560 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GODWAY: Only Up Simulator invites you to a reflex and timing based platforming experience where you progress upward along rails. <br>There is only one goal: Run, overcome obstacles, jump at the right time, and reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show your skills</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/a21d6868439a90f20d25550020bd64c4.poster.avif?t=1778571483\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/a21d6868439a90f20d25550020bd64c4.webm?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/a21d6868439a90f20d25550020bd64c4.mp4?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A hypnotic experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/23bef0a46896361bb5b7666111b97a04.poster.avif?t=1778571483\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/23bef0a46896361bb5b7666111b97a04.webm?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/23bef0a46896361bb5b7666111b97a04.mp4?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t get caught in traps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/9ec7601475aa9f3b1b910791ca756b6c.poster.avif?t=1778571483\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/9ec7601475aa9f3b1b910791ca756b6c.webm?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/9ec7601475aa9f3b1b910791ca756b6c.mp4?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast and No stopping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/01a206d9bb4215c32e8dec2c43ee1dd1.poster.avif?t=1778571483\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/01a206d9bb4215c32e8dec2c43ee1dd1.webm?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/01a206d9bb4215c32e8dec2c43ee1dd1.mp4?t=1778571483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●<strong>Rail-Based Platform Action:</strong><br>Move only on the rails and keep going without falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●<strong>Reflex-Focused Gameplay:</strong><br>Speed, timing, and awareness are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●<strong>Increasing Difficulty:</strong><br>In Godway, the closer you get to the top, the harder and more dangerous the path becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●<strong>Evolving Character:</strong><br>Run faster, jump higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●<strong>Minimalist Atmosphere:</strong><br>Simple yet memorable visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●<strong>Addictive Gameplay:</strong><br>It can hypnotize both players and viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GODWAY takes the spirit of the Only Up genre and transforms it into a fully rail-based, speed-driven experience. Instead of freely roaming, you’re constantly in motion, where split-second decisions determine everything. There’s no luxury of slowing down. No time to think. Only forward. Only upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your character progresses, they grow stronger—running faster and jumping higher. This progression provides both mechanical and emotional satisfaction. Every checkpoint is a breath of relief; every new section is a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual design is intentionally minimal. Its clean aesthetic removes unnecessary distractions, allowing you to focus entirely on reflexes and platforming. Simplicity here is not a limitation, but a deliberate choice. It offers an immersive experience for both players and viewers, making it especially suitable for streaming content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How far can you go on the rail-bound path to the top?</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/extras/4b4d5233a822f7db0826c93f05810835.avif?t=1778571483\" width=1560 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GODWAY: Only Up Simulator invites you to a reflex and timing based platforming experience where you progress upward along rails. <br>There is only one goal: Run, overcome obstacles, jump at the right time, and reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show your skills</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i